          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Located South of 30A<br>- Short walk to the beach<br>- Access to 4 neighborhood pools<br>- Access to fitness center and racquet club<br>- Private pool<br>- Outdoor kitchen<br>- Open floor plan<br>- Professionally decorated<br>- 3 adult bikes<br>- Tesla charging station in garage<br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - ALL linens, including comforter covers, are laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: The Sanctuary is a south-of-30A, 3-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom Rosemary Beach home that sleeps 14. Guests will love the short walk to the beach, the homeâ€™s wide wrap-around balcony, and the private courtyard that includes a fireplace, outdoor kitchen, and pool.<br><br>Guests enter into an open living, dining, and kitchen area with exposed timber ceiling beams, a tile floor, and a refined coastal aesthetic. A white and bright gourmet kitchen has premium appliances, a Thermador 4-burner gas range with a griddle, and gorgeous Calcutta marble countertops that lead to an adjacent butlerâ€™s pantry with additional storage. Windows and French doors wrap around the living and dining area, filling the space with natural light. A bedroom is tucked off the living area. Guests can recline on a wraparound sofa and watch TV, and enjoy music on the SONOS sound system. Guests will love this private oasis! They can relax in the shade of a covered porch or step down to a landscaped courtyard. A stone walkway connects a dining area to a luxurious outdoor kitchen with a marble counter, a gas grill, 2 gas cooktops, and a stand-alone ice maker.<br><br>On the homeâ€™s second floor, a primary and a guest bedroom enjoy private access to a wraparound balcony with views of the courtyard and surrounding Rosemary Beach. Guests who need to combine work with their time at the beach have 2 built-in desks off the laundry room to choose from.<br><br>An open loft living area on the third floor gives guests sleeping in one of the 6 twin beds or 2 trundles a place to lounge before drifting off to sleep.<br><br>Guests can easily explore Rosemary Beach on 3 included adult bikes. The Racquet Club, 4 community pools, restaurants, shopping, and a fitness center are all within short walking distance. With its wonderful courtyard and south-of-30A location, The Sanctuary will book quickly. Please call 360 Blue today to secure your next 30A beach escape!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: (SLEEPS 14):<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>-Half Bathroom: Toilet Only<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>-Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower and Tub<br>-Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>-Additional Sleeping: Six Twin Beds with Two Twin Trundles, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>*Your rental property may share a courtyard or lot with a carriage house that is owner-occupied or rented to separate guests from your party.<br><br>*This rental is not pet-friendly.",
